    {"id":"policy","type":"inputNode","position":{"x":610,"y":-150},"data":{"label":"Action Result Interpretation Task","nodeType":"text_input","properties":{"message":"Interpret one correlated robot action result and update the current Robot Status objective from evidence. The returned terminal report proves whether the sent action executed; a current camera frame proves only what is visible from the robot's camera. Robot Status provides the objective and prior context but is not new physical proof. Determine whether the objective is now complete, remains incomplete, failed at this step, or should wait. Do not choose, recommend, or dispatch another action. Preserve the objective accurately. response is optional and must be empty unless one concise sentence is useful. Return only the requested JSON.","inputKey":""}}},
